implement a add client form component with following context:

- use react hook form with yup for form validation
- use mui form component
- use 36px horizontal padding
- use 36px horizontal margin
- use mui standard variant of form components
- form component label spec:
  - font size: 18px
  - font weight: 500
  - color: primary.dark
- form component lable spec:
  - font size: 18px
  - font weight: 500
  - color: black
- add two buttons at lower right corner of the form
  - back
    - variant: outlined
    - text and border color: black
  - submit
    - variant: contained
    - button fill color: primary.main
    - text: white

- each row will take 3 inputs in following order:
  first row:
    - First Name
    - Last Name
    - Address
  second row: 
    - Date of Birth
    - Contact Email
    - Contact Cell Numb
  - third row:
    - company Name
    - price
    - comments
for date of birth use built in calendar library